#: includes/class-yperf-w3tc-migration-executor.php
msgid ""
"W3 Total Cache Object Cache is active and YPerf Object Cache is not yet "
"proven active."
msgstr ""
"Object Cache de W3 Total Cache está activo y todavía no se ha demostrado que"
" Object Cache de YPerf esté activo."

#: includes/class-yperf-w3tc-migration-executor.php
msgid ""
"W3 Total Cache Object Cache is still enabled. YPerf Object Cache is active, "
"but the old responsibility must be intentionally retired before plugin "
"deactivation."
msgstr ""
"Object Cache de W3 Total Cache sigue activado. Object Cache de YPerf está "
"activo, pero debe retirarse intencionadamente la responsabilidad anterior "
"antes de desactivar el plugin."

#: includes/class-yperf-provider-inspector.php
