msgstr ""
"W3 Total Cache no confirmó la retirada solicitada. Se restauró la "
"configuración anterior del proveedor."

msgid ""
"W3 Total Cache handoff was confirmed by the administrator and YPerf "
"migration proof passed."
msgstr ""
"El administrador confirmó la transferencia de W3 Total Cache y la prueba de "
"migración de YPerf se superó."

#: includes/class-yperf-provider-inspector.php
msgid ""
"W3 Total Cache is active, but its configuration API is not available in this"
