#: includes/class-yperf-w3tc-migration-executor.php
msgid "W3 Total Cache is being deactivated before YPerf claims its bounded layers."
msgstr ""
"Se está desactivando W3 Total Cache antes de que YPerf asuma sus capas "
"limitadas."

msgid ""
"W3 Total Cache is inactive because the administrator changed its status in "
"WordPress. YPerf can now reconcile only the prepared replacement layers."
msgstr ""
"W3 Total Cache está inactivo porque el administrador cambió su estado en "
"WordPress. YPerf ya puede conciliar únicamente las capas de sustitución "
"preparadas."

msgid ""
"W3 Total Cache is inactive, but no prepared user-directed handoff exists. "
"YPerf will not change another plugin’s activation status."
msgstr ""
"W3 Total Cache está inactivo, pero no hay ninguna transferencia preparada "
"por el usuario. YPerf no cambiará el estado de activación de otro plugin."

#: includes/class-yperf-w3tc-responsibility-resolver.php
msgid ""
"W3 Total Cache is no longer active, so its responsibility cannot be changed "
"here."
msgstr ""
"W3 Total Cache ya no está activo, por lo que aquí no se puede modificar su "
"responsabilidad."

#: includes/class-yperf-w3tc-migration-executor.php
msgid "W3 Total Cache is not active, so there is nothing to hand over."
msgstr "W3 Total Cache no está activo, así que no hay nada que transferir."

#: includes/class-yperf-w3tc-migration-executor.php
