#: includes/class-yperf-admin.php
msgid ""
"YPerf is restoring only settings it previously changed and will not "
"overwrite unrelated external drift."
msgstr ""
"YPerf solo restaura los ajustes que cambió previamente y no sobrescribe "
"cambios externos ajenos."

#: includes/class-yperf-admin.php
msgid ""
"YPerf is warming a bounded set of high-value public URLs so the first "
"visitor does not pay the cold-cache cost."
msgstr ""
"YPerf precalienta un conjunto limitado de URL públicas valiosas para que el "
"primer visitante no pague el coste de la caché fría."

#: includes/class-yperf-environment-check.php
msgid ""
"YPerf keeps this option visible so the user can install or ask the host for "
"it later."
msgstr ""
"YPerf mantiene visible esta opción para que el usuario pueda instalarla o "
"solicitarla al proveedor de alojamiento más adelante."

msgid ""
"YPerf made no plugin activation changes. Review the page-cache ownership "
